{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24038","headline":"履信池樱桃岛上醉後走笔送别舒员外兼寄宗正李卿考功崔郎中 · 白居易","name":"履信池樱桃岛上醉後走笔送别舒员外兼寄宗正李卿考功崔郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樱桃岛前春，去春花万枝。\n忽忆与宗卿闲饮日，又忆与考功狂醉时。\n岁晚无花空有叶，风吹满地乾重叠。\n蹋叶悲秋复忆春，池边树下重殷勤。\n今朝一酌临寒水，此地三回别故人。\n樱桃花，来春千万朵，来春共谁花下坐。\n不论崔李上青云，明日舒三亦抛我。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}